 "brief": "Gaza's government media office committed all available capacities to support upcoming elections as a fixed national obligation, Shehab Wire reported. The office stressed the need to work toward empowering the central elections commission to perform its administrative duties.\n\nThe announcement came as the government signaled its backing for the electoral process. Officials emphasized coordination among competent authorities to mobilize resources necessary for the elections to proceed. No timeline or specific details about the electoral calendar were disclosed in the statement.",
